  "title": "AXIL Brands Schedules Fiscal Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2026 Earnings Release and Conference Call for August 18 Conference Call Slated for 5:00 PM ET",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, August 11, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) AXIL Brands, Inc. (“AXIL,” “we,” “us,” “our,” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: AXIL), an emerging global consumer products company for AXIL® hearing protection and enhancement products and Reviv3® hair and skin care products, today announced that the company expects to report its Fiscal Fourth Quarter and Full Year results for the periods ending May 31, 2026, on Tuesday, August 18, after the close of the market.",
